Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.29,0:01:05.41,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(362,378)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.00,0:01:12.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给章鱼哥先生的信
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:12.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Delivery for Mr. Squidward tentacles
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.63,0:01:12.38,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(798,414)}章鱼哥先生\N裤头村蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.38,0:01:13.67,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(168,928)}邮件
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.47,0:01:15.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.47,0:01:15.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.63,0:01:16.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有没有人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.63,0:01:16.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Anybody here?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.99,0:01:18.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥不在岗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.99,0:01:18.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward's not at his post
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.74,0:01:38.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,少了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.74,0:01:38.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's something missing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.87,0:01:53.59,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1188,154)}此处点餐
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.10,0:01:42.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.10,0:01:42.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.08,0:01:45.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,信送到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.08,0:01:45.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mail delivery
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好  我是章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello, I'm Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.30,0:01:49.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.30,0:01:49.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.09,0:01:51.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们从不离岗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.09,0:01:51.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,where we never leave our post
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.82,0:01:57.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天天气这么好  需要什么服务
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.82,0:01:57.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And how may I help you on this fine day?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.99,0:02:03.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.99,0:02:03.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.86,0:02:17.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,垃圾老倒我头上  根本睡不了美容觉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.86,0:02:15.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's hard to get my beauty sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.44,0:02:17.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,when people keep dropping junk on my head
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.92,0:02:19.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.92,0:02:19.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hooray
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.07,0:02:33.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我慢着
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.07,0:02:33.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Avast, there
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.02,0:02:34.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们是在高兴个什么劲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.02,0:02:34.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you all happy about?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.59,0:02:36.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我在边高兴边休息  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.59,0:02:36.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm on my happy break, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.67,0:02:38.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你这样我倒是习惯了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.67,0:02:38.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You I'm used to
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.37,0:02:39.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他又高兴个什么劲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.37,0:02:39.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why is he so happy?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.38,0:02:40.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我手上这封信
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.38,0:02:40.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm holding a package
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.61,0:02:43.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是知名制片人巴迪梭寄来的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.61,0:02:43.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,from famous producer buddy barracuda
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.43,0:02:44.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我把我写的剧本寄给了他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.43,0:02:44.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I sent him my play
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.82,0:02:46.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他现在要把它排演出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.82,0:02:46.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and now he's gonna produce it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.02,0:02:48.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我辞职
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.02,0:02:48.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I quit
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.98,0:02:51.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,永别了  废物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.98,0:02:51.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So long, losers
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.44,0:02:52.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来看看
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.44,0:02:52.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's see here
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.45,0:02:53.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.45,0:02:53.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.01,0:02:54.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感谢您提交剧本
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.01,0:02:54.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Thank you for submitting your play
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.77,0:02:57.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,题为章鱼哥  神来之笔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.77,0:02:57.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"entitled Squidward: Strokes of genius
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.08,0:03:01.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,您的著作深刻阐述了你身为艺术家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.08,0:03:01.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Your work speaks volumes about you as an artist
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.15,0:03:04.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一个人  以及社会一分子的意义
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.15,0:03:04.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"a person, and a member of society
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.05,0:03:06.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因此我们很荣幸宣布
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.05,0:03:06.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"So it is with great pleasure that we announce
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.58,0:03:09.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们决定不排演您的剧本
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.58,0:03:09.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we will not be doing your play"
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.75,0:03:16.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.75,0:03:16.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.45,0:03:19.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你这位伟大的剧作家功成名就回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.45,0:03:19.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're back from your amazing success as a play writer
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.32,0:03:22.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有你的衬衣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.32,0:03:22.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And your shirt
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.32,0:03:24.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是棉涤纶混纺的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.32,0:03:24.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is that a cotton-poly blend?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.17,0:03:25.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好讲究
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.17,0:03:25.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fancy
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.71,0:03:28.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再看看你雅致的新发型
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.71,0:03:28.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And just look at your stylish new hairdo
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.39,0:03:31.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是你剧本的副本吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.39,0:03:31.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Say, is that a copy of your play?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.65,0:03:33.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.65,0:03:33.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, my goodness
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.03,0:03:34.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要在我们小小的蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.03,0:03:34.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna put on your amazing play
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.72,0:03:36.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,出演你的惊奇好戏吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.72,0:03:36.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,at our little old Krusty Krab?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.86,0:03:38.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你真是个艺术赞助人  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.86,0:03:38.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You are a true patron of the arts, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.92,0:03:41.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应该可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.92,0:03:41.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose that could work
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.37,0:03:43.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大伙儿看了我的戏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.37,0:03:43.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If people see my play
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.25,0:03:45.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就会认可我的才华
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.25,0:03:45.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,they'll recognize my genius
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.51,0:03:47.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后我就能成名  再然后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.51,0:03:47.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I'll become famous, and
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.79,0:03:52.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我客人是来花天价品鉴油腻快餐的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.79,0:03:52.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me customers come here for greasy food at high prices
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.95,0:03:54.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是来听你唱歌看你跳舞的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.95,0:03:54.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,not for singing and dancing
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.33,0:03:56.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我的戏没有唱歌
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.33,0:03:56.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But my play doesn't have singing and--
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.90,0:03:58.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.90,0:03:58.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.32,0:03:59.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大伙花钱是来吃东西的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.32,0:03:59.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,people pay to eat, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.76,0:04:00.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,确实
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:00.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.63,0:04:02.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那大伙也就会花钱看戏了对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.63,0:04:02.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And they would pay to watch a play, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.46,0:04:04.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应该吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.46,0:04:04.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I suppose
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.18,0:04:06.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是大伙边吃边看戏
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.18,0:04:06.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, if they eat and watch a play
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.92,0:04:08.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就可以收双倍的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.92,0:04:08.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you can charge twice as much
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.72,0:04:09.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.72,0:04:09.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.52,0:04:10.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那收四倍怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.52,0:04:10.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How 'bout four times as much?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.95,0:04:12.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没什么毛病
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.95,0:04:12.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't see why not
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.67,0:04:13.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.67,0:04:13.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.77,0:04:15.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧  但是只有一个条件
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.77,0:04:15.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, but only on one condition
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.77,0:04:16.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们俩都得一直干活
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.77,0:04:16.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that you both keep working
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.12,0:04:20.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要有个蟹黄堡送迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.12,0:04:20.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'cause if just one Krabby Patty is late
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.10,0:04:21.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就立刻叫停
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.10,0:04:21.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm shutting you down
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.70,0:04:23.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要怎么称呼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.70,0:04:23.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, what will we call
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.94,0:04:26.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个既能吃饭又能看戏的剧院呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.94,0:04:26.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,this eating dinner and watching theater?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.53,0:04:28.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吃饭剧院
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.53,0:04:28.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Dinner theater?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.49,0:04:31.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.49,0:04:31.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.24,0:04:32.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行  得了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.24,0:04:32.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, come on
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.48,0:04:33.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,认真一点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.48,0:04:33.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's get serious
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.21,0:04:36.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,称号得听起来很
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.21,0:04:36.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We need a title that sounds
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.83,0:04:37.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,夸张
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.83,0:04:37.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Dramatic
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.54,0:04:39.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:39.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Got it
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.70,0:04:43.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就叫  吃唱时光
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.70,0:04:43.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We'll call it "singy eaty time"
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.12,0:04:45.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是海绵宝宝  我的戏没有唱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.12,0:04:45.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But, SpongeBob, there's no singing in my--
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.25,0:04:46.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.25,0:04:46.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I love it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.64,0:04:49.64,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(704,796)}吃唱时光\N试镜
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.52,0:04:59.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这么多胸怀抱负的演员
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.52,0:04:59.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look at all these aspiring actors
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.85,0:05:01.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都想参演我的巨作
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.85,0:05:01.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,wanting to take part in my genius
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.60,0:05:06.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且个个都愿意打白工
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.60,0:05:06.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And all of them willing to work for no pay
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.12,0:05:18.13,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1082,318)}试镜
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.30,0:05:19.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我领到戏份了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.30,0:05:19.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did I get the part?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.85,0:05:21.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所有戏份都归你了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.85,0:05:21.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You've got all the parts
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.32,0:05:22.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:22.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.62,0:05:23.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.62,0:05:23.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.84,0:05:25.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还要让他来负责给咱伙食吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.84,0:05:25.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And we let him handle our food?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.47,0:05:29.09,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(862,234)}今晚首秀
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.88,0:05:30.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吃唱时光  章鱼哥主演
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.88,0:05:30.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Singy eaty time with Squidward tentacles"
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.40,0:05:36.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好  我能点餐吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.40,0:05:36.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello, can I order?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.58,0:05:38.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.58,0:05:38.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.15,0:05:40.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,时候到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.15,0:05:40.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's time
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.32,0:05:42.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,各位就位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.32,0:05:42.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Places, people
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.34,0:05:42.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.34,0:05:42.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Places
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.27,0:05:44.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请就座
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.27,0:05:44.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please take your seats
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.53,0:05:46.32,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(180,364)}灯光
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.55,0:05:45.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,调暗观众席灯光
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.55,0:05:45.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Dim the house lights
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.45,0:05:52.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,点亮舞台灯光
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.45,0:05:52.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bring up the stage lights
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.95,0:05:53.83,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(272,478)}舞台灯光
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.54,0:06:01.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,升起幕布
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.54,0:06:01.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Raise the curtain
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.79,0:06:03.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,演这出能赚多少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.79,0:06:03.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How much am I getting for this?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.52,0:06:11.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,曾几何时  章鱼降世
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.52,0:06:11.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Unto this world, an octopus was born
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.67,0:06:15.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,前途光明  身怀潜质
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.67,0:06:15.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a cephalopod with promise and potential
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.17,0:06:17.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要来份双层蟹黄堡套餐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.17,0:06:17.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd like a double krabby meal
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.80,0:06:18.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海草条多来点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.80,0:06:18.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with extra kelp
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.75,0:06:19.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走开走开
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.75,0:06:19.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go away, go away
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.36,0:06:19.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.36,0:06:19.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Shoo, shoo
Dialogue: 1,0:06:20.38,0:06:21.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我先前怎么跟你说的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:21.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.57,0:06:23.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好干活  不然我就立刻叫停
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.57,0:06:23.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You do your job, or I'm shutting you down
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.39,0:06:23.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.39,0:06:23.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fine
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.54,0:06:30.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,待他入职了蟹堡王  前途便消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.54,0:06:25.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He had promise
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.86,0:06:30.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,until he came to work here at the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.02,0:06:32.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,终日为本地白痴提供
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.02,0:06:32.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,serving local morons
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.10,0:06:35.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能让心脏骤停  动脉堵塞的垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.10,0:06:35.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,heart-stopping, artery-clogging garbage
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.01,0:06:38.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而这垃圾伪装成了食物
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.01,0:06:38.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,masquerading as food
Dialogue: 1,0:06:42.27,0:06:46.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他的才华  在这蟹堡王荒废了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.27,0:06:46.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,At the Krusty Krab, his talent was wasted
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.42,0:06:47.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.42,0:06:47.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.17,0:06:48.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我能续杯吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.17,0:06:48.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can I get a refill?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.60,0:06:49.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才不
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.60,0:06:49.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, you ca--
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.39,0:06:50.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.39,0:06:50.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.40,0:06:52.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然能了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.40,0:06:52.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, you can
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.75,0:06:57.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但谁又能续填我灵魂中的裂谷呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.75,0:06:57.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But who will refill the empty chasm in my soul?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.12,0:06:59.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道  老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.12,0:06:59.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know, man
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.54,0:07:01.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.54,0:07:01.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.27,0:07:05.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他的一生支离破碎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.27,0:07:05.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,His life shattered
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.02,0:07:09.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们的主角还会背负更丢脸的任务吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.02,0:07:09.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is there any task too demeaning for our hero?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.60,0:07:11.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的蟹黄堡没番茄酱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.60,0:07:11.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My Krabby Patty doesn't have ketchup
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.08,0:07:13.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来并不会
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.08,0:07:13.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It would appear not
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.05,0:07:15.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没番茄酱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.05,0:07:15.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No ketchup?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.29,0:07:16.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也太糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.29,0:07:16.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's terrible
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.62,0:07:18.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来  我帮你加
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.62,0:07:18.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here, let me help you with that
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.77,0:07:23.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们谁还想要这份工作
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.77,0:07:23.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would any of you want this job?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.92,0:07:26.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  去给那客人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.92,0:07:26.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, you get that customer
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.66,0:07:28.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现做一份加番茄酱的蟹黄堡  快
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.66,0:07:28.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a fresh patty with ketchup, now
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.40,0:07:30.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别忘了再给他收一次费
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.40,0:07:30.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And don't forget to charge him again
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.70,0:07:34.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而后  还有我那吝啬的老板
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.70,0:07:34.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And then, there's my skinflint boss
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.38,0:07:36.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说什么  章鱼哥先生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.38,0:07:36.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's that, Mr. Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.20,0:07:39.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是蟹老板  我在演戏啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.20,0:07:39.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But Mr. Krabs, I'm acting
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.57,0:07:41.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,行吧  那没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.57,0:07:41.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, that's okay then
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.25,0:07:43.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但务必给他现做蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.25,0:07:43.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But get him a Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.77,0:07:44.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.77,0:07:44.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fine
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.52,0:07:47.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  来份加番茄酱的蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.52,0:07:47.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, one Krabby Patty with ketchup
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.57,0:07:51.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,接下来是我工作当中最恶劣的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.57,0:07:51.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And now we come to the worst part of my job
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.47,0:07:54.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,同他共事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.47,0:07:54.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,working with him
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.86,0:07:59.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.86,0:07:59.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The--
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.12,0:08:00.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.12,0:08:00.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the--
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.60,0:08:03.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我忘词了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.60,0:08:03.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I forgot my line
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.97,0:08:05.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你压根就没词
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.97,0:08:05.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't have any lines
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.61,0:08:06.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.61,0:08:06.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.17,0:08:07.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  站那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.17,0:08:07.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, just stand there
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.70,0:08:09.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,演出
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.70,0:08:09.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and act like
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.88,0:08:11.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的天性
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.88,0:08:11.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yourself
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.60,0:08:13.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个我会
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.60,0:08:13.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can do that
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.68,0:08:16.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一份蟹黄堡马上来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.68,0:08:16.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One Krabby Patty coming up
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.87,0:08:20.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.87,0:08:20.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.97,0:08:22.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我厨房里有片流浪包装纸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.97,0:08:22.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A stray wrapper in my kitchen?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.44,0:08:25.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,垃圾桶满了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.44,0:08:25.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The trash is full
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.69,0:08:29.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最好打电话找垃圾车来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.69,0:08:29.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I had better call the garbage truck
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.57,0:08:38.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才华
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.57,0:08:38.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Talent
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.23,0:08:41.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,杰出
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.23,0:08:41.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Outstanding
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.48,0:08:43.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.48,0:08:43.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.25,0:08:44.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.25,0:08:44.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That'll do
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.22,0:08:47.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但大家瞧好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.22,0:08:47.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But lo and behold
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.27,0:08:49.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老兄  我的蟹黄堡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.27,0:08:49.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, man, where's my Krabby Patty?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.47,0:08:52.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他怀才不遇
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.47,0:08:52.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,His genius was unrecognized
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.42,0:08:53.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.42,0:08:53.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, man
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.99,0:08:55.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只想要我的蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.99,0:08:55.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just want my patty
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.44,0:08:56.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.44,0:08:56.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.82,0:08:59.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不被当一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.82,0:08:59.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Taken for granted
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.35,0:09:02.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,被埋没  被忽略
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.35,0:09:02.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,uncredited, overlooked
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.09,0:09:04.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,被无视
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.09,0:09:04.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,ignored
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.12,0:09:08.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不被尊重
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.12,0:09:08.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Disrespected
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.58,0:09:11.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,无人赏识
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.58,0:09:11.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,unappreciated
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.00,0:09:12.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,无人爱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.00,0:09:12.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,unloved
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.08,0:09:14.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但最惨的就是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.08,0:09:14.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But worst of all
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.41,0:09:17.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,工资低
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.41,0:09:17.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Underpaid
Dialogue: 1,0:09:19.12,0:09:20.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太好笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.12,0:09:20.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's funny
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.75,0:09:22.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为讲得可对了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.75,0:09:22.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'cause it's true
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.53,0:09:25.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他讲完了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.53,0:09:25.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's done
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.36,0:09:26.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,点餐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.36,0:09:26.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Order
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.65,0:09:28.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,此外
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.65,0:09:28.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And furthermore
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.67,0:09:30.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,永远也讲不完
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.67,0:09:30.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's forevermore
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.50,0:09:32.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,壮志未酬
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.50,0:09:32.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Unfulfilled
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.85,0:09:36.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总而言之  他的各种才华均已
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.85,0:09:36.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In a word, his myriad of talents were
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.88,0:09:38.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,磨灭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.88,0:09:38.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wasted
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.82,0:09:41.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.82,0:09:41.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.12,0:09:43.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们要蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.12,0:09:43.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We want Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.17,0:09:45.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们要蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.17,0:09:45.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We want Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.37,0:09:48.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  你还是没给我客人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.37,0:09:48.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, you still haven't given me customers
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.32,0:09:49.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,端出蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.32,0:09:49.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,their Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.49,0:09:50.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.49,0:09:50.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.69,0:09:52.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  蟹黄堡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.69,0:09:52.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, where's that patty?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.22,0:09:58.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我干了什么好事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.22,0:09:58.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What have I done?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.92,0:10:01.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,难道演戏的诱惑就此害得我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.92,0:10:01.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Have I let the lure of theater production
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.05,0:10:02.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,无心再做蟹黄堡了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.05,0:10:02.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,get between me and my patties?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.35,0:10:04.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  原谅我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.35,0:10:04.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, forgive me
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.82,0:10:06.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我被舞台的虚荣迷了眼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.82,0:10:06.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I let the glamour of the stage
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.29,0:10:07.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,偏离了我真正的天职
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.29,0:10:07.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,distract me from my true calling
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.20,0:10:11.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也就是确保我做出的每个蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.20,0:10:11.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,making sure that every Krabby Patty I prepare
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.62,0:10:13.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都精益求精
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.62,0:10:13.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is the best it can be
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.07,0:10:15.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  千万不要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.07,0:10:15.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, Squidward, no
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.67,0:10:18.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这蟹黄堡可不适合给大家吃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.67,0:10:18.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Those patties aren't fit for public consumption
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.17,0:10:21.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给  吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.17,0:10:21.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here, enjoy
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.77,0:10:27.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.77,0:10:27.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.75,0:10:29.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等那么久就等来个这个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.75,0:10:29.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All that waiting for this?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:30.03,0:10:31.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.03,0:10:31.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Puh-lease
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.05,0:10:33.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不当面打脸怕连啥是高质量都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.05,0:10:33.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't know quality if it hit you in the face
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.67,0:10:36.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当面打你们的脸才对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.67,0:10:36.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I said if it hit you in the face
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.70,0:10:39.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是值得一等
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.70,0:10:39.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was worth the wait
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.40,0:10:40.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要再来俩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.40,0:10:40.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll take two more
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.38,0:10:41.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要来五个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.38,0:10:41.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll take five
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.37,0:10:42.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要朝他丢东西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.37,0:10:42.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I want to throw something at him
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.93,0:10:48.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  咱都想朝他丢东西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.93,0:10:48.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we all want to throw something at him
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.78,0:10:49.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别吵
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.78,0:10:49.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Quiet
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.51,0:10:54.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,各位文雅的客人  蟹黄堡是用来吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.51,0:10:54.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gentle patrons, Krabby Patties are meant to be eaten
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.10,0:10:55.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是用来丢的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.10,0:10:55.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,not flung
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.42,0:10:59.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想想这些油腻又多汁的蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.42,0:10:59.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Think of all the joy these greasy, juicy patties
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.18,0:11:01.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有里面的配料  带来了多少欢乐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.18,0:11:01.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and their attendant condiments have given you
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.41,0:11:02.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊  他说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.41,0:11:02.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gosh, he's right
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.69,0:11:04.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们不该这么不尊重
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.69,0:11:04.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't be so disrespectful
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.51,0:11:05.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们最爱的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.51,0:11:05.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of our favorite meal
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.55,0:11:07.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,祝福大家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.55,0:11:07.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bless you all
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.77,0:11:09.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我喜欢丢吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.77,0:11:09.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I like throwing food
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.05,0:11:13.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,食物大战
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.05,0:11:13.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Food fight
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.41,0:11:15.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.41,0:11:15.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And for you?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.81,0:11:17.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要20份
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.81,0:11:17.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll take 20
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.12,0:11:19.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有重一点的东西没
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.12,0:11:19.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you have anything heavier?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.32,0:11:21.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然有了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.32,0:11:21.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Certainly
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.59,0:11:28.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.59,0:11:28.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.75,0:11:32.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.75,0:11:32.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.44,0:11:33.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.44,0:11:33.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.05,0:11:35.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.05,0:11:35.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good news
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.55,0:11:37.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这场戏可成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.55,0:11:37.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The play is such a success
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.10,0:11:40.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以要加演两场  外加一次午后场
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.10,0:11:40.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've added two more shows and a matinee
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.00,0:11:41.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,祝你们明天大获成功
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.00,0:11:41.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Break a leg tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.00,0:11:41.50,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(888,920)}断         腿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.81,0:11:55.31,起司 一般标题,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fsp50}马术赛风波
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.61,0:11:57.82,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz27.52\pos(240,448)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.61,0:12:00.24,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.61,0:11:57.82,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz27.52\pos(480,710)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.90,0:12:00.24,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(412,438)\frz29.51}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.90,0:12:00.24,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.51\pos(540,682)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.36,0:12:02.82,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.51\pos(432,530)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.36,0:12:02.82,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 2,0:12:05.53,0:12:10.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,啊  深海多么宽广无垠
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.53,0:12:10.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ahh, the eternal expanse of the deep sea
Dialogue: 2,0:12:10.33,0:12:12.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,充满着各种神奇的生物
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.33,0:12:12.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,teeming with fantastic creatures
Dialogue: 2,0:12:14.96,0:12:15.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,充满着
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.96,0:12:15.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Teeming
Dialogue: 2,0:12:16.29,0:12:18.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,生物一定就在这附近
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.29,0:12:18.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're around here somewhere
Dialogue: 2,0:12:21.26,0:12:22.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是石头
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.26,0:12:22.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's a rock
Dialogue: 2,0:12:22.84,0:12:24.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家都去哪了
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.84,0:12:24.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where is everybody?
Dialogue: 2,0:12:26.64,0:12:28.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,原来只是海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.64,0:12:28.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It is just SpongeBob
Dialogue: 2,0:12:28.76,0:12:30.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,仔细看好
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.76,0:12:30.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Watch and witness
Dialogue: 2,0:12:30.35,0:12:33.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,深海最稀有最神秘的仪式之一
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.35,0:12:33.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,one of the rarest and mysterious rituals of the deep
Dialogue: 2,0:12:33.85,0:12:35.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干瞪眼比赛
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.85,0:12:35.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the staring contest
Dialogue: 2,0:12:51.20,0:12:53.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  哇
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.20,0:12:53.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, wow
Dialogue: 2,0:12:53.25,0:12:53.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.25,0:12:53.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 2,0:12:53.87,0:12:56.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是我瞪过最厉害的干瞪眼能手了
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.87,0:12:56.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You are the best starer I've ever stared at
Dialogue: 2,0:12:57.46,0:12:59.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,原来是干瞪眼比赛
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.46,0:12:59.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Staring contest
Dialogue: 2,0:12:59.80,0:13:01.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还以为是眨眼比赛
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.80,0:13:01.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought it was a blinking contest
Dialogue: 2,0:13:01.84,0:13:02.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,差点要输了
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.84,0:13:02.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I was losing
Dialogue: 2,0:13:04.51,0:13:05.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你听  派大星
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.51,0:13:05.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hark, Patrick
Dialogue: 2,0:13:05.38,0:13:06.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有听到什么吗
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.38,0:13:06.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you hear something?
Dialogue: 2,0:13:12.64,0:13:14.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是给珊迪的信
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.64,0:13:14.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a letter for Sandy
Dialogue: 2,0:13:14.14,0:13:16.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从德克萨斯一路寄来的
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.14,0:13:16.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,all the way from Texas
Dialogue: 2,0:13:16.06,0:13:17.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最好快送过去
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.06,0:13:17.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We better deliver it
Dialogue: 2,0:13:19.11,0:13:20.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.11,0:13:20.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy
Dialogue: 2,0:13:22.15,0:13:23.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,打不开啊这
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.15,0:13:23.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's not opening
Dialogue: 2,0:13:23.36,0:13:24.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.36,0:13:24.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 2,0:13:24.44,0:13:26.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我有样东西  应该能帮得上忙
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.44,0:13:26.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have something that might help
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.11,0:13:27.82,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\an3\pos(522,748)}如何打开东西\N第一版
Dialogue: 2,0:13:26.11,0:13:27.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,如何打开东西
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.11,0:13:27.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"How to open things"
Dialogue: 2,0:13:28.07,0:13:29.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,妙啊  派大星
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.07,0:13:29.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Brilliant, Patrick
Dialogue: 2,0:13:29.24,0:13:31.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,电影我看过  原著没看过
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.24,0:13:31.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I saw the movie, but I never read the book
Dialogue: 2,0:13:32.20,0:13:33.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.20,0:13:33.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
