Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.41,0:13:34.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Garbage cans
Dialogue: 2,0:13:35.12,0:13:35.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.12,0:13:35.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
