Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.71,0:13:41.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy's door
Dialogue: 2,0:13:42.50,0:13:44.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,向左转
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.50,0:13:44.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Twist to the left"
Dialogue: 2,0:13:45.17,0:13:46.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我刚刚向右转了
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.17,0:13:46.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was twisting to the right
Dialogue: 2,0:13:46.72,0:13:48.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这种错误很容易犯  我的好朋友
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.72,0:13:48.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A common mistake, my good friend
Dialogue: 2,0:13:48.93,0:13:49.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让我来
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.93,0:13:49.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Allow me
Dialogue: 2,0:13:54.72,0:13:58.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在来开门了
Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.72,0:13:58.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, time to open this
Dialogue: 2,0:14:01.19,0:14:03.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想用忍术偷袭是吗
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.19,0:14:03.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Trying a ninja sneak attack?
Dialogue: 2,0:14:05.49,0:14:08.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们还不是我松鼠功夫的对手
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.49,0:14:08.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, you're still no match for my squirrel fu
Dialogue: 2,0:14:09.61,0:14:11.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是我双胞胎兄弟蓝迪寄来的信
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.61,0:14:11.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a letter from my twin brother Randy
Dialogue: 2,0:14:16.00,0:14:17.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,介不介意
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.00,0:14:17.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you mind?
Dialogue: 2,0:14:17.66,0:14:18.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.66,0:14:18.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not at all
Dialogue: 2,0:14:18.67,0:14:19.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,继续看
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.67,0:14:19.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Read on
Dialogue: 2,0:14:19.29,0:14:20.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我无所谓
Dialogue: 1,0:14:19.29,0:14:20.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Doesn't bother me
Dialogue: 2,0:14:20.38,0:14:21.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,滚出我的衣服
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.38,0:14:21.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get out of my suit
Dialogue: 2,0:14:24.34,0:14:25.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好家伙
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.34,0:14:25.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, golly
Dialogue: 2,0:14:25.42,0:14:27.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蓝迪说马术赛来镇上了
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.42,0:14:27.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Randy says the rodeo's come to town
Dialogue: 2,0:14:27.67,0:14:30.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我得回德克萨斯卫冕冠军
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.67,0:14:29.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've got to head back to Texas
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.22,0:14:30.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and defend my championship title
Dialogue: 2,0:14:30.97,0:14:32.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,卫冕冠军
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.97,0:14:32.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Championship title?
Dialogue: 2,0:14:32.26,0:14:32.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,啥冠军
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.26,0:14:32.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 2,0:14:32.85,0:14:34.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你耳朵是进棉花了吗
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.85,0:14:34.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You got cotton in your ears?
Dialogue: 2,0:14:34.89,0:14:36.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,并不是棉花
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.89,0:14:36.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, it's not cotton
Dialogue: 2,0:14:36.52,0:14:39.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其实是一小块的发霉陈年蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.52,0:14:39.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's actually an old moldy piece of Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 2,0:14:41.98,0:14:44.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是不是捉水母冠军
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.98,0:14:44.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is your championship title for jellyfishing?
Dialogue: 2,0:14:44.44,0:14:44.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.44,0:14:44.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 2,0:14:44.94,0:14:45.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,空手道
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.94,0:14:45.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Karate?
Dialogue: 2,0:14:46.28,0:14:46.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.28,0:14:46.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 2,0:14:46.78,0:14:48.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就应该是科学展会了
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.78,0:14:48.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the science fair, then
Dialogue: 2,0:14:48.19,0:14:51.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  是我马术赛冠军要不保了
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.19,0:14:51.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, it's my rodeo championship on the line
Dialogue: 2,0:14:51.24,0:14:52.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,马术赛
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.24,0:14:52.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Rodeo?
Dialogue: 2,0:14:52.87,0:14:54.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,马术赛是什么意思
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.87,0:14:54.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What does "rodeo" mean?
Dialogue: 2,0:14:55.41,0:14:58.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要套住各种牲畜
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.41,0:14:58.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Critters that you got to wrangle
Dialogue: 2,0:14:58.41,0:15:01.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,穿上亮片牛仔服
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.41,0:15:01.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cowboy suits with purdy spangles
