Dialogue: 2,0:16:41.06,0:16:42.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小丑
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.06,0:16:42.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Clowns?
Dialogue: 2,0:16:42.06,0:16:43.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别去  珊迪
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.06,0:16:43.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't go, Sandy
Dialogue: 2,0:16:43.10,0:16:44.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,风险太大了
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.10,0:16:44.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's too risky
Dialogue: 2,0:16:44.31,0:16:45.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我必须去
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.31,0:16:45.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I must
Dialogue: 2,0:16:45.27,0:16:46.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,职责在身
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.27,0:16:46.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's my duty
Dialogue: 2,0:16:57.91,0:16:58.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太可怕了
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.91,0:16:58.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is terrible
Dialogue: 2,0:16:59.08,0:17:01.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不能让珊迪单独过去
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.08,0:17:01.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We can't let Sandy go all alone
Dialogue: 2,0:17:01.24,0:17:03.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那边太危险了  对吧派大星
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.24,0:17:03.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous up there, right, Patrick?
Dialogue: 2,0:17:04.83,0:17:07.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不关  我的事
Dialogue: 1,0:17:04.83,0:17:07.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm in-diff-er-ent
Dialogue: 2,0:17:07.88,0:17:09.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样我们还怎么心安理得
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.88,0:17:09.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How could we live with ourselves
Dialogue: 2,0:17:09.34,0:17:12.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪都快要受伤了  我们却没去帮忙
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.34,0:17:12.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,if Sandy got hurt and we weren't there to help?
Dialogue: 2,0:17:12.01,0:17:14.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都没法直视我自己了
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.01,0:17:14.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, I wouldn't be able to look at myself
Dialogue: 2,0:17:14.59,0:17:16.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,直视自己
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.59,0:17:16.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look at yourself?
Dialogue: 2,0:17:16.43,0:17:17.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你怎么做到的
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.43,0:17:17.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How do you do that?
Dialogue: 2,0:17:22.97,0:17:23.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.97,0:17:23.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 2,0:17:23.89,0:17:26.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没空胡闹了
Dialogue: 1,0:17:23.89,0:17:26.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is no time for silly games
Dialogue: 2,0:17:26.19,0:17:27.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪需要我们
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.19,0:17:27.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy needs us
Dialogue: 2,0:17:27.98,0:17:28.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明不明白
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.98,0:17:28.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You understand?
Dialogue: 2,0:17:29.48,0:17:30.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.48,0:17:30.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick?
Dialogue: 2,0:17:30.44,0:17:31.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.44,0:17:31.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick?
Dialogue: 2,0:17:31.57,0:17:32.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别紧身牛仔裤了
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.57,0:17:32.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No more tight jeans
Dialogue: 2,0:17:33.86,0:17:35.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,肯定还有谁可以帮我
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.86,0:17:35.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sure someone else will help me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.28,0:17:38.11,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(428,466)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 2,0:17:38.41,0:17:40.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,事情就是这样  蟹老板
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.41,0:17:40.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So there you have it, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 2,0:17:40.24,0:17:42.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪真的需要我们帮忙
Dialogue: 1,0:17:40.24,0:17:42.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy really needs our help
Dialogue: 2,0:17:42.04,0:17:44.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  再跟我说说是怎么个事
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.04,0:17:44.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, explain it to me again
Dialogue: 2,0:17:44.54,0:17:45.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过这回呢
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.54,0:17:45.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but this time
Dialogue: 2,0:17:45.46,0:17:47.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟赚钱没关系的就别提了
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.46,0:17:47.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,take out anything that doesn't have to do with money
Dialogue: 2,0:17:49.29,0:17:50.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不出所料
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.29,0:17:50.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought
Dialogue: 2,0:17:51.84,0:17:54.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我需要找到某位有同情心的
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.84,0:17:54.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I need to find someone with compassion
Dialogue: 2,0:17:54.76,0:17:56.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,某位能够无私伸出援手的
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.76,0:17:56.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,someone who selflessly helps others
Dialogue: 2,0:17:56.76,0:17:59.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还不顾自身安危的
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.76,0:17:59.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with no concern for his own safety
Dialogue: 2,0:17:59.01,0:17:59.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我需要
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.01,0:17:59.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I need
Dialogue: 2,0:18:00.18,0:18:01.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,英雄
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.18,0:18:01.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a hero
Dialogue: 2,0:18:04.43,0:18:05.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.43,0:18:05.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 2,0:18:05.23,0:18:06.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪有可怕的麻烦
Dialogue: 1,0:18:05.23,0:18:06.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy is in terrible trouble
Dialogue: 2,0:18:06.77,0:18:08.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定要帮我救救她啊
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.77,0:18:08.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You've go to help me save her
Dialogue: 2,0:18:08.14,0:18:09.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.14,0:18:09.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 2,0:18:09.19,0:18:10.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,莎莉有麻烦了
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.19,0:18:10.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sally's in trouble?
Dialogue: 2,0:18:11.19,0:18:11.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是珊迪
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.19,0:18:11.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy
Dialogue: 2,0:18:11.73,0:18:13.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你放心  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.73,0:18:13.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 2,0:18:13.02,0:18:14.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在这等着
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.02,0:18:14.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just wait right here
Dialogue: 2,0:18:15.99,0:18:18.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我去找紧急松鼠拯救装备
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.99,0:18:18.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll get my emergency squirrel rescue kit
Dialogue: 2,0:18:18.53,0:18:20.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你去吧  章鱼哥先生
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.53,0:18:20.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right-o, Mr. Tentacles, sir
Dialogue: 2,0:18:20.16,0:18:21.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要怕
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.16,0:18:21.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just don't panic
Dialogue: 2,0:18:32.13,0:18:34.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只剩最后一个求救对象了
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.13,0:18:34.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, there's one last person I can ask
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.96,0:18:36.84,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(642,716)}海之霸
Dialogue: 2,0:18:37.42,0:18:38.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.42,0:18:38.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton
Dialogue: 2,0:18:40.43,0:18:41.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 1,0:18:40.43,0:18:41.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 2,0:18:41.22,0:18:42.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪有麻烦了
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.22,0:18:42.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy's in trouble
Dialogue: 2,0:18:42.22,0:18:43.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我需要你帮忙拯救她
Dialogue: 1,0:18:42.22,0:18:43.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I need help rescuing her
Dialogue: 2,0:18:45.18,0:18:47.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我现在有点忙
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.18,0:18:47.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of busy right now
Dialogue: 2,0:18:47.73,0:18:49.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要一分钟就好
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.73,0:18:49.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jeepers, it'll only take a minute
Dialogue: 2,0:18:49.44,0:18:50.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.44,0:18:50.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, uh
Dialogue: 2,0:18:50.44,0:18:51.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然我很想帮忙
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.44,0:18:51.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd love to help
Dialogue: 2,0:18:51.60,0:18:53.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我真的得走了
Dialogue: 1,0:18:51.60,0:18:53.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I really got to go
Dialogue: 2,0:19:03.58,0:19:05.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我一定要去救出珊迪
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.58,0:19:05.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm going to go save Sandy
Dialogue: 2,0:19:05.62,0:19:07.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,无论有没有帮手我都义不容辞
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.62,0:19:07.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,whether anyone wants to help or not
Dialogue: 2,0:19:16.84,0:19:18.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来就只剩你跟我了  小蜗
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.84,0:19:18.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess it's just you and me, Gary
Dialogue: 2,0:19:22.39,0:19:23.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,出发吧
Dialogue: 1,0:19:22.39,0:19:23.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 2,0:19:25.35,0:19:26.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蜗牛小蜗
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.35,0:19:26.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary the snail
Dialogue: 2,0:19:26.56,0:19:27.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是想待在这里
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.56,0:19:27.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,did you plan on staying here
Dialogue: 2,0:19:27.85,0:19:30.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,连珊迪在某处有麻烦都坐视不管吗
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.85,0:19:30.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,while Sandy is possibly in trouble somewhere up there?
Dialogue: 2,0:19:31.73,0:19:32.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她是那只松鼠
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.73,0:19:32.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She's the squirrel
Dialogue: 2,0:19:33.73,0:19:34.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  棕色的
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.73,0:19:34.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, brown
Dialogue: 2,0:19:35.11,0:19:36.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗  那有什么关系
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.11,0:19:36.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary, what does that have to do--
Dialogue: 2,0:19:37.28,0:19:38.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你也不帮忙吗
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.28,0:19:38.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You too, huh?
Dialogue: 2,0:19:38.65,0:19:40.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就等着瞧
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.65,0:19:40.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, we'll see about that
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.74,0:19:41.91,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(734,344)}卓越泡泡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.74,0:19:41.91,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(724,896)}内含泡泡棒
Dialogue: 2,0:20:18.23,0:20:19.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,布丁
Dialogue: 1,0:20:18.23,0:20:19.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pudding
Dialogue: 2,0:20:57.02,0:20:58.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.02,0:20:58.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good morning
Dialogue: 2,0:20:58.23,0:21:00.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  你这是什么意思
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.23,0:21:00.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, what's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 2,0:21:00.61,0:21:02.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪有麻烦了  我需要你们帮忙
Dialogue: 1,0:21:00.61,0:21:02.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy's in trouble, and I need all of your help
Dialogue: 2,0:21:02.86,0:21:05.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拯救她  逃离恐怖马术赛
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.86,0:21:05.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to save her from the horrors of the rodeo
Dialogue: 2,0:21:05.20,0:21:06.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那里有小丑
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.20,0:21:06.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There are clowns there
Dialogue: 2,0:21:06.82,0:21:10.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  下次再邀请我
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.82,0:21:10.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, the next time you "invite" me
Dialogue: 2,0:21:10.58,0:21:11.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来参加你开的睡衣派对
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.58,0:21:11.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to one of your slumber parties
Dialogue: 2,0:21:11.95,0:21:13.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就要报警了
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.95,0:21:13.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm calling the cops
Dialogue: 2,0:21:20.67,0:21:21.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.67,0:21:21.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What the--
Dialogue: 2,0:21:21.96,0:21:23.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.96,0:21:23.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 2,0:21:24.97,0:21:25.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么了  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.97,0:21:25.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, Squidward?
Dialogue: 2,0:21:26.88,0:21:28.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,气死我了
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.88,0:21:28.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am disgruntled
Dialogue: 2,0:21:33.98,0:21:35.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这到底是什么地方
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.98,0:21:35.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where in the devil are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.31,0:21:37.69,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(928,746)}德克萨斯
Dialogue: 2,0:21:35.48,0:21:36.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 1,0:21:35.48,0:21:36.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's
Dialogue: 2,0:21:36.48,0:21:37.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,德克萨斯
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.48,0:21:37.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Texas
Dialogue: 2,0:21:44.24,0:21:45.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说什么  小蜗
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.24,0:21:45.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's that, boy?
Dialogue: 2,0:21:45.24,0:21:46.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你看到珊迪了吗
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.24,0:21:46.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You see Sandy?
Dialogue: 2,0:21:47.20,0:21:47.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她在
Dialogue: 1,0:21:47.20,0:21:47.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And she's
Dialogue: 2,0:21:48.24,0:21:49.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,骑牛蛙吗
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.24,0:21:49.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,riding a bullfrog?
Dialogue: 2,0:21:53.79,0:21:55.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪你好啊
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.79,0:21:55.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ahoy, Sandy
Dialogue: 2,0:21:59.13,0:22:00.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,搞什么
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.13,0:22:00.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gall darn it
Dialogue: 2,0:22:00.46,0:22:02.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们几个城市佬害我马术赛输了
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.46,0:22:02.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You city slickers made me lose the rodeo
Dialogue: 2,0:22:03.05,0:22:04.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,到底干嘛过来
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.05,0:22:04.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why are you here, anyways?
Dialogue: 2,0:22:04.21,0:22:07.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,救你逃离马术赛
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.21,0:22:07.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,To help save you from this rodeo thing
Dialogue: 2,0:22:07.30,0:22:09.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用不着你们救
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.30,0:22:09.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't need to be saved
Dialogue: 2,0:22:09.89,0:22:10.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.89,0:22:10.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Watch out
Dialogue: 2,0:22:10.89,0:22:12.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那牛蛙肚子上面有跳蚤
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.89,0:22:12.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That old bullfrog's got a flea on its flanks
Dialogue: 2,0:22:12.97,0:22:13.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要朝你们跳过去了
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.97,0:22:13.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and he's coming right at ya
Dialogue: 2,0:22:24.48,0:22:26.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,救到珊迪了没
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.48,0:22:26.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did we save Sandy?
Dialogue: 2,0:22:26.32,0:22:28.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  没救到
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.32,0:22:28.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, Patrick, we didn't
Dialogue: 2,0:22:28.32,0:22:29.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有赚到钱吗
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.32,0:22:29.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did we make any money?
Dialogue: 2,0:22:30.49,0:22:31.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完了
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.49,0:22:31.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aw, cactus
Dialogue: 2,0:22:31.57,0:22:33.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那头牛蛙逮到海绵宝宝了
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.57,0:22:33.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That ol' bullfrog's got SpongeBob
Dialogue: 2,0:22:34.33,0:22:35.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,撑住  老兄
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.33,0:22:35.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hang on, old buddy
Dialogue: 2,0:22:43.38,0:22:45.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下次  别来插手马术赛
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.38,0:22:45.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Next time, leave the rodeos to me
Dialogue: 2,0:22:46.80,0:22:47.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.80,0:22:47.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nuts
